<title>AUSTRIA: Iran would support 1-year OPEC rollover.</title>
<headline>Iran would support 1-year OPEC rollover.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iranian Oil Minister Gholamreza Aqazadeh told reporters at the OPEC meeting that he would support a rollover of current quotas for 12 months.</p>
<p>He said that &quot;this will be better than six months. OPEC needs to be careful&quot;.</p>
<p>Algeria has also said it would not object to a 12-month rollover but its minister, Amar Makhloufi, doubted if such a proposal would be agreed by OPEC.</p>
</text>
